03:40:43,822 --> 03:40:53,508
The user interface and integration layer allows for smooth interaction with conversational UIs, making it easy for users to communicate with the agent.

1841
03:40:54,574 --> 03:41:06,148
Platform APIs provide the necessary integration points for external systems and real-time communication support, ensures that the agent can interact with users instantly.

