2957
05:33:58,190 --> 05:34:03,908
This sets the foundation for writing agent prompts that lead to consistent, high-quality results.

2958
05:34:04,398 --> 05:34:10,180
When assigning tasks to an agent, one of the most important things you can do is to find clear boundaries.

2959
05:34:10,830 --> 05:34:18,372
Without boundaries, the agent may overanalyze and gather irrelevant data, or sometimes even misinterpret your intentions.

2960
05:34:19,086 --> 05:34:21,348
